OL,3,GNEWSAExplosion reported before Ipswich
OL,4,Agarage fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Fat a commercial garage unit involving
OL,8,Fmultiple vehicles after callers
OL,9,Freported hearing an explosion and
OL,10,Fseeing thick, black smoke.
OL,12,FCrews were sent to Portmans Walk near
OL,13,FIpswich Town's stadium, just before
OL,14,F11:30 GMT.
OL,16,FA Suffolk Fire Service spokesperson
OL,17,Fsaid crews wearing breathing apparatus
OL,18,Fwere tackling the blaze, which measures
OL,19,Fabout 20m by 5m (65ft by 16ft) and is
OL,20,Fthe other side of the road from the
OL,21,Fhousehold waste recycling centre and
OL,22,Fbeyond the Dunwell Motor Group plot.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
