OL,3,GNEWSAExplosion reported before Ipswich
OL,4,Agarage fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews from Ipswich East, Holbrook,
OL,7,FNeedham Market, Stowmarket and Nayland
OL,8,Fhave been at the scene and police
OL,9,Fcordoned off Sir Alf Ramsey Way between
OL,10,FWest End Road and Constantine Road.
